   "description": "One checklist item: its dependents, its cycles, their spend and the events about it. An event is about the item when its payload's `item_id` or `item` is the item's id, its `items` holds the id, or it was recorded in one of the item's cycles. The item's cycles are the (non-empty) `cycle_id`s of the events whose `item_id` or `item` is the item's id, in the order first recorded; `spend` sums the cost ledger's calls in those cycles.",
